brief.update(reference='TRACK-A',professional_capability=contract['capability'],dominant_learner_action='Inspect, map and judge a bounded body of work against criteria; concise writing supports judgment, never dominates.',emotional_cognitive_rhythm='Orientation and scan → focused criterion mapping → accountable recommendation → a visible contradiction and consequence → clarification → reconsideration and calm closure. One review page with inline disclosure, no nested stage tabs.',visual_interaction_metaphor='A compact review dossier with three criterion rows and a decision memo. Existing shell/tokens; sources are traceable documents, not selectable quiz answer cards.',density_scroll_expectation=contract['responsive']['density']+' Initial collapsible outline targets two desktop or four narrow-mobile viewport heights; this is a usability review target, not permission to clip content. 8–12 minute hypothesis; measure at implementation.',reference_work_balance='Read mostly supplied work. Source excerpts stay one disclosure away from each criterion; source links return focus to the mapping row. Avoid a permanently expanded long reference column on mobile.',authored_writing_burden='Two fields total: rationale ≤45 words and next-step note ≤35 when route/gaps require it; ≤600 characters each; no word minimum. Reuse the same fields during reconsideration; no per-source note, per-criterion reason, four-section repair or separate revision essay. Current record ≤80 words; two-record maximum ≤160 words even if both are wholly rewritten. GR05 has diagnoses, four repaired sections, eight review rounds’ criterion responses and a revision rationale; GR06 has five source notes, two interpretation/limitation pairs, six decision fields and update/review writing. Track A replaces that repeated authoring with three structured mapping rows. Aim 25–50 words per recommendation as optional guidance only.',desktop_mobile_transformation=contract['responsive']['desktop']+' '+contract['responsive']['mobile'],magnetic_experience_moment='A confident “all activities complete” claim looks ready until its evidence links expose prepared-not-received and unsupported authority. The learner can record not yet without failing, then see exactly what a clarification changes—and what it still does not prove.',reuse_rationale='Reuse shell/basic UI and unchanged generic recovery. Harvest immutable version and traceability principles without importing the deep-workspace models. Propose a genuinely typed assessment bundle and readiness interaction, with opt-in scenario/composition variants; no objects registered. Mighty content rows inform scanning only; no vendor CSS or new visual system.',difference_from_recent_references='GR05: author and repair four sections, long studio drafting rhythm, paired artifact comparison. GR06: source-note/interpretation/decision authoring with U01, dense multi-stage workspace; user review sets it as the upper burden bound, not the next template. Track A: compact dossier, three review rows, four supplied artifacts, two concise fields, visible readiness consequence and a short current-version reconsideration. Mobile uses criterion-linked inline evidence rather than nested stage tabs or horizontal matrices. Novelty comes from assessment sufficiency and agency in not yet, not a color/layout variation.')
